{"id":1137,"date":"2024-08-20T15:59:45","date_gmt":"2024-08-20T15:59:45","guid":{"rendered":"..\/..\/..\/..\/index.html"},"modified":"2026-01-19T04:36:00","modified_gmt":"2026-01-19T04:36:00","slug":"biologia-molecular","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"..\/..\/..\/..\/biologia-molecular\/","title":{"rendered":"Biolog\u00eda Molecular"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1137\" class=\"elementor elementor-1137\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a584e6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a584e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e7f73a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8e7f73a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bea40d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7bea40d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"522\" src=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Rafael-Salazar-1024x522.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2841\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Rafael-Salazar-1024x522.png 1024w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Rafael-Salazar-300x153.png 300w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Rafael-Salazar-768x391.png 768w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Rafael-Salazar.png 1348w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a5b3dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9a5b3dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b185ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b185ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Pre-Requisitos:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Base en ciencias biol\u00f3gicas, qu\u00edmicas o de la salud.<\/li><li>Haber completado \u226580 % de la carrera o haber cursado materias como Bioqu\u00edmica, Biolog\u00eda Molecular, Gen\u00e9tica, Biotecnolog\u00eda o afines.<\/li><li>Inter\u00e9s en herramientas bioinform\u00e1ticas; no se requiere experiencia previa extensa.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10894fc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"10894fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab7135b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ab7135b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Rafael Enrique Salazar Claros<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75e13f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"75e13f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Taller sobre clonaci\u00f3n de pl\u00e1smidos: del dise\u00f1o a experimentos.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a88288e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a88288e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Descripci\u00f3n del taller:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">El Taller \u201cClonaci\u00f3n de pl\u00e1smidos: del dise\u00f1o a experimentos\u201d est\u00e1 orientado a estudiantes avanzados de Biolog\u00eda, Medicina y \u00e1reas afines, con formaci\u00f3n previa en Gen\u00e9tica y Biolog\u00eda Molecular. A lo largo de tres sesiones de 2 horas, los participantes adquirir\u00e1n conocimientos y habilidades para dise\u00f1ar estrategias de clonaci\u00f3n de pl\u00e1smidos, utilizando tanto enfoques te\u00f3ricos como herramientas bioinform\u00e1ticas.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">El programa avanza desde los fundamentos conceptuales, pasando por el dise\u00f1o in silico y la planificaci\u00f3n experimental, hasta llegar a la aplicaci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica y an\u00e1lisis funcional de secuencias proteicas en repositorios como UniProt y Pfam. Mediante actividades colaborativas y pr\u00e1cticas, los estudiantes desarrollar\u00e1n competencias aplicables a la investigaci\u00f3n en biolog\u00eda molecular, integrando teor\u00eda, dise\u00f1o y simulaci\u00f3n experimental en un mini-proyecto grupal.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Al finalizar el taller, los participantes ser\u00e1n capaces de seleccionar y planificar estrategias de clonaci\u00f3n, analizar secuencias g\u00e9nicas y proteicas en funci\u00f3n de objetivos experimentales y entender c\u00f3mo la clonaci\u00f3n contribuye al estudio y modificaci\u00f3n funcional de prote\u00ednas.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pre-Requisitos: Base en ciencias biol\u00f3gicas, qu\u00edmicas o de la salud. Haber completado \u226580 % de la carrera o haber cursado materias como Bioqu\u00edmica, Biolog\u00eda Molecular, Gen\u00e9tica, Biotecnolog\u00eda o afines. Inter\u00e9s en herramientas bioinform\u00e1ticas; no se requiere experiencia previa extensa. Rafael Enrique Salazar Claros Taller sobre clonaci\u00f3n de pl\u00e1smidos: del dise\u00f1o a experimentos. Descripci\u00f3n del taller:&nbsp;El [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1137","page","type-page","status-publish"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1137","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"."}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1137"}],"version-history":[{"count":33,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1137\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3174,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1137\/revisions\/3174"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1137"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}